        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 2105, Classic Privacy Mortise Pocket Door Hardware</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Classic Pocket Door Privacy Set has a timeless design that makes it a great choice for almost any decor. This mortise sliding door privacy set comes packaged with 2 flush pulls and a privacy function mortise box. The interior plate has a thumbturn and the exterior plate has an emergency release turn.  Choose from several lovely finishes for an end look that shows off your style. A privacy function locks but can be easily unlocked from the outside via an emergency turn.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Privacy Lock:</b> Locks but has access to unlock from the outside via emergency turn. Privacy locks do not offer security, they offer privacy.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/classic-pocket-door-dummy-set-emtek-2106\"><b>Dummy Set</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/classic-pocket-door-passage-set-emtek-2104\"><b>Passage Set</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/classic-pocket-door-keyed-entry-emtek-2103\"><b>Keyed Entry Function</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Classic Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Face Plate Height: 7-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Projection: 1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Height: 5-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Width: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Width: 17/20\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Projection: 23/25\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Finger Pull: is thrown by pressing the button on the mortise's face plate. It can be retracted simply by pressing it flush with the faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-2105-specifications.pdf?v=1704262358\"><b>Emtek 2105 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) rectangle flush pulls, a privacy mortise, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
